7b3532b081107d, https://si.imgix.net/14ec1c76/uploads/origins/d8fd454b-b003-4460-bfa3-707cca5a59e9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b5f7c91c5fc5dc6a2db5f7cabcf758e9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/14ec1c76/uploads/origins/d8fd454b-b003-4460-bfa3-707cca5a59e9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=54c12b6cf8d78da5c3549f8709cd0ab2 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "VtuberのZumi Dokumiのアートが欲しい。彼女は生意気なカエルゲーマーだ。彼女にポケモンシリーズのバグキャッチャーの格好をしてもらいたい。白いノースリーブのシャツに青いショートパンツ、サンダル、麦わら帽子。大きなちょうちょの網も持っていてほしい。昆虫入れも持たせたい。彼女のポーズは、見る人に向かって網を振りかざそうとしているように見えるはずだ。\n\nドクミズミ参考：https://imgur.com/pTGgOHF\n虫捕り衣装参考：https://danbooru.donmai.us/posts/5975882 https://danbooru.donmai.us/posts/6373195 https://danbooru.donmai.us/posts/950798", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@illustsaboko/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c3ae84f4/uploads/origins/e3f40fac-091a-4b74-b540-43e75d1c8bdc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d11a178a750b7ffee409978389b482c2", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c3ae84f4/uploads/origins/e3f40fac-091a-4b74-b540-43e75d1c8bdc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d11a178a750b7ffee409978389b482c2, https://si.imgix.net/c3ae84f4/uploads/origins/e3f40fac-091a-4b74-b540-43e75d1c8bdc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d46dd6807b719b3d2c052bd400ade1f6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c3ae84f4/uploads/origins/e3f40fac-091a-4b74-b540-43e75d1c8bdc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=65a2ae0fa7d017d1202bee27feba5624 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, nice to meet you!\nI would like to get something for an original character if possible. The character's name is Yae.\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/19Eiis6RxZIVwr6eFQuTgxNsbsZ3TtO4H?usp=drive_link\n\nPlease draw Yae drinking at her computer.  Yae should look slightly drunk.\nIt looks like she is gaming or talking with friends.  She has a happy look on her face.\nShe is wearing small shorts and a tank top.  Her hair is a mess.\n\nHave fun with the request! Change or add details to meet intent.\n\nThank you for drawing Yae !\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/19Eiis6RxZIVwr6eFQuTgxNsbsZ3TtO4H?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@illustsaboko/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/586720dc/uploads/origins/03748ea3-f6a7-40a0-8965-68565ab26c4f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=09dfea2511a698d0964ba9a83dd7bf8c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/586720dc/uploads/origins/03748ea3-f6a7-40a0-8965-68565ab26c4f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=09dfea2511a698d0964ba9a83dd7bf8c, https://si.imgix.net/586720dc/uploads/origins/03748ea3-f6a7-40a0-8965-68565ab26c4f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=34d488f2a4fcf1660550d31024c9b500 2x, https://si.imgix.net/586720dc/uploads/origins/03748ea3-f6a7-40a0-8965-68565ab26c4f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3633b5642a3a89d3d55b5afc3749c3d2 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "I ABSOLUTELY ADORE THE SNOWBOARD COMMISSION YOU MADE FOR ME OMG\nI'm gonna get some more commissions from you since you are SO DAMN AWESOME.\nI want Poko Rakun(1) about to go downhill a road while riding a bike, you can choose the outfit, either her normal standard one, or a summer vibe one if you prefer so! On the basket of the bike, there'd be one or some of her mascots, the fandits(2), and it/they would be really scared of what's about to happen, like when you are on the top part of a roller coaster!\nI would like the piece to have a summer vibe to it, if it's possible! Anything else is up to you, I trust you 100%\nReferences:\nhttps://imgur.com/a/rUpHp9X\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/rUpHp9X", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@illustsaboko/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/df19bc3c/uploads/origins/dbd8c587-6169-41fa-89f6-42cf066141c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d95a00e8c41d503cd3bc37f3047b4d2b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/df19bc3c/uploads/origins/dbd8c587-6169-41fa-89f6-42cf066141c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d95a00e8c41d503cd3bc37f3047b4d2b, https://si.imgix.net/df19bc3c/uploads/origins/dbd8c587-6169-41fa-89f6-42cf066141c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=082d912cf7d21ebc6125b758a6f8f64c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/df19bc3c/uploads/origins/dbd8c587-6169-41fa-89f6-42cf066141c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b02a04265c904a40d238fc40051b8fdf 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hiii!\nI love the Pochi commissions you've made so far, they are beautiful, so I wanted to commission something for the vtuber of the same company, second generation, Poko Rakun(1)! I wanted to commission Poko skiing down a snowy hill, with some winter clothes to be protected and a really smug face, looking like a pro! If there could be some of her mascots, small fandits(2), snowboarding/skiing/doing other things, and being a bit clumsy about it around her, even better! \nReferences:\nhttps://imgur.com/a/rUpHp9X", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@illustsaboko/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/80a46f61/uploads/origins/a80cbb54-bd7c-4ef1-824f-b0f0e9bcf131?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8003c475c9ce7fa2ab5acb516f0af62a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/80a46f61/uploads/origins/a80cbb54-bd7c-4ef1-824f-b0f0e9bcf131?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8003c475c9ce7fa2ab5acb516f0af62a, https://si.imgix.net/80a46f61/uploads/origins/a80cbb54-bd7c-4ef1-824f-b0f0e9bcf131?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f23f8f3294a64d6fc54c688051385ba0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/80a46f61/uploads/origins/a80cbb54-bd7c-4ef1-824f-b0f0e9bcf131?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8e8b3ba284d09c35ee7f33a4a0d6f839 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、以前に描いてくれたPochi Wanmaruが可愛いので、彼女の新姿を描いてお願いしたいです。\n\nこの新しいデザインを描いて欲しい\nhttps://twitter.com/kither444/status/1716232930635255990\n\n参考と違って、下は黒いスパッツにしてくれると嬉しい。\n\nポーズは、手を膝に乗せて座っていることにしたいです。\nこのように\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/111456455\n\nバックグラウンドはおまかせします。\nあと、バック無しの絵も含めると助かります。\n\nよろしくお願いします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@illustsaboko/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ca5d0527/uploads/origins/59e3e1f4-4099-4f63-abb0-e8767c891253?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=61c44a8bf3a629e36440fbd4720f5333", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ca5d0527/uploads/origins/59e3e1f4-4099-4f63-abb0-e8767c891253?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=61c44a8bf3a629e36440fbd4720f5333, https://si.imgix.net/ca5d0527/uploads/origins/59e3e1f4-4099-4f63-abb0-e8767c891253?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=662caa854319cb831de4a59faaa1327c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ca5d0527/uploads/origins/59e3e1f4-4099-4f63-abb0-e8767c891253?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bc1c004817413e9fc3cb19acb932cbcf 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "この子を正面から持ち上げてる絵を描いてもらいたいです\n顔が笑って、目が閉じてる近いアングルでお願いします\nバックグラウンドは簡単な空で、白い雲チラホラあるにして下さい\n服は参考のように、フード無しに描いて下さい\nよろしくお願いします\n\n描いてもらいたい子はこのVtuberのPochi Wanmaru\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/102596326\n\nこのようなポーズでお願いします\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/46277995", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@illustsaboko/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a3d9970d/uploads/origins/d6e671ac-b315-4082-932e-46f68520261a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=13983fcd43914f08b9823bd6e1f72527", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a3d9970d/uploads/origins/d6e671ac-b315-4082-932e-46f68520261a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=13983fcd43914f08b9823bd6e1f72527, https://si.imgix.net/a3d9970d/uploads/origins/d6e671ac-b315-4082-932e-46f68520261a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=685cb5a23c5cb6cac2f379f1c5a4828e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a3d9970d/uploads/origins/d6e671ac-b315-4082-932e-46f68520261a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9bbf7df6fcf874649095418a90dbf035 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Thank you for the appeal.\n\nI would like to request an illustration by VTuber \"Lily-Crawford\".\nhttps://twitter.com/Lily__Crawford/status/1491382224104861696\n\nThe situation, etc. is up to you.\nIf possible, please use 16:9 aspect ratio.\n(If it is compositionally difficult, it doesn't have to be 16:9.)\n\nWe would appreciate your consideration.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}